{
  "$about": [
    "The quiz «Выбрать кофе за минуту» (session 4 of choosing coffee): its four questions, what each answer does to the visitor's place on the taste map, and the words of the result. build/quiz.mjs reads it with src/data/choose.json (the brewing methods and what QQ sells for each, the map) and src/data/taste.json (positions, flavour profiles, the anchors, the coffee page's moves), and writes src/data/quiz.json for the page; src/scripts/quiz.js is the arithmetic, the same in the build and in the browser. How it works: docs/quiz.md. Every result of every answer, listed: docs/quiz-output.md.",
    "A visitor is a region on the taste model's visible axes (bright = acidity, body = density, unusual = ferment and processing), centre and spread, as in src/scripts/taste.js. `now` sets where it starts: one of the taste model's anchors (taste.json anchors.drinks, by name), widened, or the model's START. `taste` moves the centre towards its own point by `weight` and narrows the spread; `milk` shifts it and prefers QQ's milk-tagged coffees. «Не знаю» changes nothing and turns the result into three different coffees.",
    "Never «Оценка Q», never a decaf for a visitor who did not ask for one, never a coffee QQ has run out of (data/site.json shop.unavailable), never a roast the method does not take: build/quiz.mjs fails if any result breaks one of these."
  ],
  "title": "Выбрать кофе за минуту",
